{"type":"text","timestamp":1790351984710,"sessionID":"ses_f26b565efffeD4GhTU1poM6EJn","part":{"id":"prt_0d94b481f001jFWnQD6JlI6ODv","messageID":"msg_0d94b0b1c001CP3x2ZGrk2OWsi","sessionID":"ses_f26b565efffeD4GhTU1poM6EJn","type":"text","text":"The collision handler isn’t connected, both quest identifiers are incorrect, and the enemy’s group is serialized incorrectly. I’ll fix those so hits register, call `QuestManager.progress_quest(\"shoot_em_up\", \"kill_step\")`, and keep the existing cleanup at 50 pixels above the screen.","time":{"start":1790351984671,"end":1790351984677},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_039d8066661ce1e5016ab69a6f645c8196b6488af9369604e5","phase":"commentary"}}}}
